  "body": "Whether you are a growing family, a first-home buyer, a downsizer, or looking for the perfect coastal investment, this beautiful 3-bedroom home in the heart of Stanmore Bay delivers on every front. Combining relaxed beachside living with ultimate convenience, this is a property that demands your immediate attention.\r\n\r\nThe Highlights\r\n• Move-In Ready excellence: Meticulously maintained and freshly renovated, this home offers modern comfort and total peace of mind. All the hard work has been done for you! Also Healthy Homes compliant!\r\n• 3 Generous Bedrooms with a Peep of the Sea: Bright, airy, and thoughtfully designed with family comfort in mind. Positioned beautifully on an elevated site, you can catch a glimpse of the sea.\r\n• The Ultimate Entertainer's Deck & Garden: Step outside to a great deck overlooking a fantastic, fully fenced back garden. It’s the perfect, secure setup for summer BBQs, kids at play, and pets to roam freely.\r\n• Huge Double Garage + Off-Street Parking: Plenty of room for cars, beach gear, tools, or a home gym, plus additional off-street parking.\r\n• Elevated, Private & Off the Road: Tucked away from the roadside, enjoy a wonderfully quiet, peaceful, and private sanctuary.\r\n\r\nYou are perfectly positioned to enjoy everything the vibrant Hibiscus Coast lifestyle has to offer:\r\n• Education: In-zone and within easy reach of highly regarded local schools (Stanmore Bay Primary and Whangaparaoa College) and nearby childcare centres.\r\n• Convenience: Minutes away from the Stanmore Bay New World, local shops, cafes, and the Stanmore Bay Pool and Leisure Centre.\r\n• The Beach: The pristine sands of Stanmore Bay Beach are just moments away for your morning swim or weekend stroll.\r\n\r\nThe Future-Proof Advantage: Penlink!\r\nCommuters rejoice! This property is situated incredibly close to the upcoming Penlink connection. Your commute to Albany and the CBD is about to be massively fast-tracked. This makes the property not just a beautiful, turnkey home, but a stellar, strategic financial investment for your future.\r\n\r\nAct Fast! Don't wait for the weekend open home. Properties that successfully bundle this level of fresh renovation, outdoor space, garaging, and future infrastructure benefits are snapped up fast on the Peninsula.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nKeyword:: Stanmore Bay, Hibiscus Coast, Whangaparaoa, 3 Bedrooms, Double Garage, Penlink, Close to Beach, Fully Fenced Garden, Family Home, First Home Buyer, Renovated, Well Maintained.",
